      "content": "but it wasnt just anxiety. like, i literally felt a sharp pang in my chest exactly 2 seconds before the flash crash hit. the screen didnt even flicker yet. if it was just fear, wouldnt the heart rate spike *after* seeing the red candles? it felt like the physical sensation preceded the visual data. how do you explain the timing being that precise?",
